# Tiny test morphology: a two-point soma (type 1) with a basal dendrite (type 3)
# that bifurcates once. Radii in um. Used to exercise the SWC path of the model
# spec loader and the d_lambda compartmentalisation rule.
1 1 0 0 0 10 -1
2 1 0 10 0 10 1
3 3 0 20 0 1 2
4 3 0 120 0 1 3
5 3 0 220 0 1 4
6 3 100 220 0 0.8 5
7 3 -100 220 0 0.8 5
